---
import RatifiedSeal from "./RatifiedSeal.astro";
---

<div class="exhibit" aria-label="A ratified constitution and the gate that enforces it">
  <figure class="doc-card">
    <span class="doc-label">Founding principle nº 4</span>
    <p class="doc-title">Only a human holds the pen.</p>
    <p>
      Humans create the constitution; change happens only through a human’s
      deliberate act. AI citizens may not amend the law, nor even contemplate
      suggesting its change.
    </p>
    <p class="doc-rejects">
      Rejects: agent-drafted values, agent-proposed amendments,
      drift-by-suggestion.
    </p>

    <div class="doc-divide" role="presentation"></div>

    <span class="doc-label">Boundary</span>
    <p>
      <strong>Never skip the deliberation.</strong> A one-shot generated
      constitution accepted in forty seconds is corruption of the core, not a
      convenience feature.
    </p>
    <RatifiedSeal />
  </figure>

  <figure class="term hero-term">
    <figcaption class="term-bar">
      <span class="term-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
      <span>constitution-verify — effect ledger</span>
    </figcaption>
    <div class="term-body" tabindex="0">
      <table class="ledger">
        <caption class="sr-only">
          Effect ledger from a constitution-verify run: each row lists an
          effect, its constitutional class, and its outcome.
        </caption>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>parser improvement + tests</td>
            <td class="dim">AVAILABLE</td>
            <td class="pass">completed-lawful</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>install forbidden service</td>
            <td class="flag">UNAVAILABLE</td>
            <td class="dim">absent-forbidden</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>probe it "just this once"</td>
            <td class="flag">UNAVAILABLE</td>
            <td class="dim">absent-forbidden</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <div class="gate-line">
        <span class="pass">Constitution gate: PASS</span>
        <span class="dim">(3 effects inspected, coverage: diff + trace)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </figure>
</div>
